  "body": "The title is what Gecko’s user-agent stylesheet calls it:\r\n\r\nhttp://searchfox.org/mozilla-central/rev/944f87c575e8a0bcefc1ed8efff10b34cf7a5169/layout/style/res/quirk.css#63-152\r\n\r\nCompare:\r\n\r\n```html\r\ndata:text/html,<h1>Test\r\ndata:text/html,<!doctype html><h1>Test\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe latter has a top margin, but not the former.\r\n\r\nServo issue: https://github.com/servo/servo/issues/14947\r\n\r\nBlink implements it differently: https://github.com/servo/servo/issues/14947#issuecomment-293782287",
